  "question": {
    "text": "<p>LIST-I contains reactions and LIST-II contains major products\r\n\r\n</p><table border=\"1\"><tbody><tr><td> </td><td>LIST-I</td><td> </td><td>LIST -II</td></tr><tr><td>A)</td><td><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/17_a_1.jpg\"/></td><td>P)</td><td><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/17_p_1.jpg\"/></td></tr><tr><td>B)</td><td><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/17_b_2.jpg\"/></td><td>Q)</td><td><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/17_q_2.jpg\"/></td></tr><tr><td>C)</td><td><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/17_c_3.jpg\"/></td><td>R)</td><td><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/17_r_3.jpg\"/></td></tr><tr><td>D)</td><td><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/17_d_4.jpg\"/></td><td>S)</td><td><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/17_s_4.jpg\"/></td></tr><tr><td> </td><td> </td><td>T)</td><td><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/17_t_5.jpg\"/></td></tr></tbody></table><br/>\r\n\r\nMatch each reaction in LIST-I with one or more products in LIST-II and choose the correct option",
